    "body": "Addressed: typed Chamfer lead lengths reset during the next UI render.\n\nCause: the Lead tab copied `lead` into a temporary shape. The type selector wrote the shape back, but a numeric edit did not write it back. The next render restored the original number.\n\nFix: the page now writes the shape back when the user selects a shape or changes its numeric value. Opening or painting the tab stays inert, so legacy operations keep their compatibility marker.\n\nNew head: `d6cbff161da44106892f831b1fae8d2ac960786d`.\n\nPin: `typing_a_chamfer_lead_size_stays_in_the_draft`.\n\nResult: the Chamfer lead UI module passed 3 tests, 0 failed. No golden files changed.\n\nThis push changes the head. It waits for a fresh review.\r\n",
